| 5 | $(1703502,\,94613,\,-9435290,\,8772028,\,-13858857,\,-1210251,\,2283681,\,3730819)$ | $-7919755$ ✓ |

Each row of $x_{k+1}$ was verified by direct matrix-vector multiplication; each sum was cross-checked via $c \cdot x_{k-1}$, with full consistency at every level.

